        735,
        168,
        770,
        881
      ],
      "margin_number": 3,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "οὐ βουλόμεθα διαβάλλειν σε ‘we don't want to slander you’: βούλομαι + the infinitive – a very common pattern.",
